# Weka package metadata
PackageName=CompositeSEM
Version=0.3.0
Date=2026-10-13
Title=Composite path modeling and covariance SEM for Weka
Category=Regression, Preprocessing
Author=Hicham CHAFAI <chafaihicham@gmail.com>
Maintainer=Hicham CHAFAI <chafaihicham@gmail.com>
License=file LICENSE
Description=CompositeSEM provides two distinct estimators: a configurable fixed-weight composite path model and a maximum-likelihood covariance SEM for reflective latent predictors with one observed numeric outcome. It includes supervised filters, Weka regressors, factor scores, covariance fit indices, a fully standardized solution, observed-information standard errors and Wald tests, serialization, command-line options, Explorer discovery and leakage-safe cross-validation. The package requires Java 17 or later. The composite estimator is not canonical iterative PLS-PM; the covariance estimator currently supports simple reflective measurement structures and paths from all latent constructs to the numeric class.
Changes=Version 0.3.0 adds a fully standardized solution, observed-Hessian standard errors, z statistics and p-values, lavaan cross-validation on two public SEM datasets, prediction benchmarks, documented numerical tolerances and packaged Javadoc.
PackageURL=https://github.com/hchafai/weka-sem/releases/download/v0.3.0/CompositeSEM-0.3.0.zip
URL=https://github.com/hchafai/weka-sem
Depends=weka (>=3.8.7)
